; Latin > Spanish in learned words: Latin stress, the accusative ending
; goes, and Latin letters are read as Spanish ones. Only what the spike's
; words need.

categories
Vs = a e i o u
Vl = ā ē ī ō ū
Ss = á é í ó ú
Sl = ā́ ḗ ī́ ṓ ū́
V = Vs Vl
S = Ss Sl
Stop = p b t d k g
L = l r
C = Stop f s h m n l r j w
end

; Latin stress, as in latin-to-wr.bsc
V / S / # C* _ C* #
Vl / Sl / _ C* V C* #
Vs / Ss / _ C C C* V C* # // _ Stop L V C* #
V / S / _ C* Vs (C) V C* # / _ C* Vs Stop L V C* #
V / S / _ C* V C* # // S C* _

[ā́ ḗ ī́ ṓ ū́ ā ē ī ō ū] / [á é í ó ú a e i o u]
u m / o / _ #
e m / / _ #
r / ɾ / _
g / x / _ [e i é í]
